  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Build the Moderator Bot\r\n\r\n## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. In `script.js`, complete `runModeratorBot()` so it builds a cleaner comment thread from `threadData`.\r\n\r\n   ::: details [Ideas for customizing your moderator bot]\r\n\r\n   - You might hide comments that are already flagged, remove comments with very low scores, prioritize trusted users with gold, or rank comments by score or time.\r\n    :::\r\n\r\n2. Your function should filter the comments, sort the comments that remain, update `displayComments`, and call `renderThread()`.\r\n\r\n3. Test your moderator bot by clicking **Run Moderator Bot**. Check that the thread shows the comments you want, hides the comments you do not want, and appears in the order you chose.",
